# mTLS certificates go here (Tier 2)
# Generate: python -m src.mtls gen-ca
#           python -m src.mtls gen-node node-1
# Files expected:
#   ca.crt         — CA certificate (shared)
#   node-1/node.crt — node certificate
#   node-1/node.key — node private key
#   node-1/ca.crt   — CA cert copy for node
# NEVER commit .key files to git